    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 12,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 2,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "## Coverage — check this before comparing any two numbers\nRecords are written in order (`call.teardown` → `call.ledger` → `case.*`) and every instrument was already live at the reset, so **these counts should now agree**. A short `call.ledger` no longer means \"instrumented later\" — it means calls are losing their ledger, which `Ava-LedgerLost` is built to catch.",
        "region": "us-west-2"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 14,
      "width": 7,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Records per source",
        "view": "bar",
        "query": "SOURCE '/aws/bedrock-agentcore/runtimes/ava_voice_agent-TVSWmk7feq-DEFAULT'\n| filter event in [\"call.teardown\",\"call.ledger\",\"case.written\",\"case.summarized\"]\n| stats count(*) as records by event\n| sort records desc",
        "region": "us-west-2"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "x": 7,
      "y": 14,
      "width": 9,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Records per source, by day",
        "view": "line",
        "query": "SOURCE '/aws/bedrock-agentcore/runtimes/ava_voice_agent-TVSWmk7feq-DEFAULT'\n| filter event in [\"call.teardown\",\"call.ledger\",\"case.written\",\"case.summarized\"]\n| stats count(*) as records by bin(1d), event",
        "region": "us-west-2"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 14,
      "width": 8,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Cost completeness — priced vs unpriced",
        "view": "table",
        "query": "SOURCE '/aws/bedrock-agentcore/runtimes/ava_voice_agent-TVSWmk7feq-DEFAULT'\n| filter event = \"call.ledger\"\n| stats count(*) as calls,\n        sum(cost_priced) as priced,\n        count(*) - sum(cost_priced) as unpriced,\n        sum(CallCostUsd) as total_usd,\n        avg(CallCostUsd) as avg_usd_priced_only,\n        sum(CallCostUsd)*60/sum(CallDurationSeconds) as usd_per_talk_min\n    by usage_mode\n| sort calls desc",
        "region": "us-west-2"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 2,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "## Escalation, engagement and quality proxies\n`escalated`, `transcript_turns` and `tool_errors` are fields on `call.ledger`, not metrics — the EMF block publishes only Calls, duration, tokens, tool calls, gate blocks and cost. These are Logs Insights queries: retroactive, but not alarmable. Rates are `sum/count(*)`, so a missing field counts as \"not X\".",
        "region": "us-west-2"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 22,
      "width": 8,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Escalation — asking for a human vs getting one",
        "view": "table",
        "query": "SOURCE '/aws/bedrock-agentcore/runtimes/ava_voice_agent-TVSWmk7feq-DEFAULT'\n| filter event = \"call.ledger\"\n| stats count(*) as calls,\n        sum(escalated) as escalated,\n        sum(escalated)*100.0/count(*) as escalation_rate_pct,\n        sum(human_handoff) as human_joined,\n        sum(human_handoff)*100.0/count(*) as handoff_rate_pct,\n        sum(escalated) - sum(human_handoff) as queued_never_joined",
        "region": "us-west-2"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "x": 8,
      "y": 22,
      "width": 8,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Engagement — did the caller get past hello",
        "view": "table",
        "query": "SOURCE '/aws/bedrock-agentcore/runtimes/ava_voice_agent-TVSWmk7feq-DEFAULT'\n| filter event = \"call.ledger\"\n| fields greatest(least(transcript_turns - 1, 1), 0) as engaged,\n         least(ToolCalls, 1) as transacted\n| stats count(*) as calls,\n        sum(engaged)*100.0/count(*) as engagement_rate_pct,\n        sum(transacted)*100.0/count(*) as transacted_rate_pct,\n        sum(transcript_turns)/count(*) as avg_turns,\n        sum(ToolCalls)/count(*) as avg_tool_calls,\n        avg(CallDurationSeconds) as aht_secs",
        "region": "us-west-2"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 22,
      "width": 8,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Quality proxies (not a quality score — see footer)",
        "view": "table",
        "query": "SOURCE '/aws/bedrock-agentcore/runtimes/ava_voice_agent-TVSWmk7feq-DEFAULT'\n| filter event = \"call.ledger\"\n| fields least(GateBlocks, 1) as hit_gate, least(tool_errors, 1) as hit_tool_error\n| stats count(*) as calls,\n        sum(GateBlocks)/count(*) as gate_blocks_per_call,\n        sum(hit_gate)*100.0/count(*) as calls_with_gate_block_pct,\n        sum(tool_errors)/count(*) as tool_errors_per_call,\n        sum(hit_tool_error)*100.0/count(*) as calls_with_tool_error_pct",
        "region": "us-west-2"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 28,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Escalation and engagement, by day",
        "view": "line",
        "query": "SOURCE '/aws/bedrock-agentcore/runtimes/ava_voice_agent-TVSWmk7feq-DEFAULT'\n| filter event = \"call.ledger\"\n| fields greatest(least(transcript_turns - 1, 1), 0) as engaged,\n         least(ToolCalls, 1) as transacted\n| stats sum(escalated)*100.0/count(*) as escalation_pct,\n        sum(human_handoff)*100.0/count(*) as handoff_pct,\n        sum(engaged)*100.0/count(*) as engagement_pct,\n        sum(transacted)*100.0/count(*) as transacted_pct\n    by bin(1d)",
        "region": "us-west-2"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 34,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 3,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "## Resolution and first contact resolution\nFrom `case.*`, written after a model reads the transcript — so a satisfied hang-up can be upgraded from `caller_disconnected` to `completed`, which is why the abandonment tile up top is an upper bound.\n\n**FCR is two halves, deliberately not averaged.** *Resolved on the call* is the transcript's judgement; *no repeat contact* is whether that policy rang again (reported as `unique policies ÷ contacts`, since Logs Insights cannot nest aggregations). `rows_judged` below `cases` shows how many rows actually carried the judgement. A `not recorded` slice is a row predating the field, not a resolution category.",
        "region": "us-west-2"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 37,
      "width": 8,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Resolution mix",
        "view": "pie",
        "query": "SOURCE '/aws/bedrock-agentcore/runtimes/ava_voice_agent-TVSWmk7feq-DEFAULT'\n| filter event = \"case.summarized\"\n| stats count(*) as calls by coalesce(resolution_status, \"not recorded\") as resolution\n| sort calls desc",
        "region": "us-west-2"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "x": 8,
      "y": 37,
      "width": 8,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Intent mix — what callers rang about",
        "view": "bar",
        "query": "SOURCE '/aws/bedrock-agentcore/runtimes/ava_voice_agent-TVSWmk7feq-DEFAULT'\n| filter event = \"case.summarized\"\n| stats count(*) as calls by coalesce(customer_intent, \"not recorded\") as intent\n| sort calls desc",
        "region": "us-west-2"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 37,
      "width": 8,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "FCR half 1 — resolved on the call",
        "view": "table",
        "query": "SOURCE '/aws/bedrock-agentcore/runtimes/ava_voice_agent-TVSWmk7feq-DEFAULT'\n| filter event = \"case.summarized\"\n| stats count(*) as cases,\n        count(caller_need_met) as rows_judged,\n        sum(caller_need_met) as resolved_on_call,\n        sum(caller_need_met)*100.0/count(*) as resolved_on_call_pct,\n        sum(upgraded) as upgraded,\n        sum(upgraded)*100.0/count(*) as upgraded_pct",
        "region": "us-west-2"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 43,
      "width": 8,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "FCR half 2 — repeat contact rate",
        "view": "table",
        "query": "SOURCE '/aws/bedrock-agentcore/runtimes/ava_voice_agent-TVSWmk7feq-DEFAULT'\n| filter event = \"case.written\" and ispresent(policy_id)\n| stats count(*) as contacts,\n        count_distinct(policy_id) as unique_policies,\n        count(*) - count_distinct(policy_id) as repeat_contacts,\n        100.0*count_distinct(policy_id)/count(*) as first_contact_pct,\n        100.0*(count(*) - count_distinct(policy_id))/count(*) as repeat_contact_pct",
        "region": "us-west-2"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "x": 8,
      "y": 43,
      "width": 16,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Who rang more than once — the calls FCR is losing to",
        "view": "table",
        "query": "SOURCE '/aws/bedrock-agentcore/runtimes/ava_voice_agent-TVSWmk7feq-DEFAULT'\n| filter event = \"case.written\" and ispresent(policy_id)\n| stats count(*) as contacts,\n        earliest(@timestamp) as first_contact,\n        latest(@timestamp) as last_contact,\n        earliest(resolution_status) as first_outcome,\n        latest(resolution_status) as last_outcome\n    by policy_id\n| filter contacts > 1\n| sort contacts desc\n| limit 50",
        "region": "us-west-2"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 49,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Connection view vs need view — every disagreement",
        "view": "table",
        "query": "SOURCE '/aws/bedrock-agentcore/runtimes/ava_voice_agent-TVSWmk7feq-DEFAULT'\n| filter event = \"case.summarized\"\n| stats count(*) as calls by coalesce(derived_status, \"not recorded\") as connection_view,\n                            coalesce(resolution_status, \"not recorded\") as need_view,\n                            coalesce(customer_intent, \"not recorded\") as intent\n| sort calls desc\n| limit 50",
        "region": "us-west-2"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 55,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 3,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "## Cost — three layers, never summed\n| Layer | Metric | What it is | Lag |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Per call | `Ava/Calls CallCostUsd` | Nova Sonic, priced from the call's own tokens | ~1 min |\n| Per service | `Ava/Cost DailyCostUsd` by `category` | what AWS **billed** | ~3 days |\n| Runtime compute | AgentCore usage logs | vCPU/GB-hours a session held open | ~1 min |\n\n`ModelProduction` **is the same money as `CallCostUsd`** — our token estimate against the bill. Comparing them is `reconcile.py`; adding them double-counts. No cost tile fills a gap with zero: unpriced reads **No data**, never $0.00.",
        "region": "us-west-2"
      }
    },
