    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 86,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 3,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "## Average quality score — not measured\nThere is no live quality score, and the proxies above are not one: they measure discipline (did gates fire, did tools fail), not whether the call was any good. `evals/golden/` is an offline pre-ship gate over 40 fixed cases and cannot score production calls. A real score needs a judge reading transcripts at teardown and publishing `QualityScore` through `emit_call_ledger` — per-call model cost, added latency, and a sampling decision. That is a feature, not a widget.",
        "region": "us-west-2"
      }
    }
